OL,3,GNEWSAClosure of region's last road
OL,4,Apolicing department a 'sad day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police chief has criticised
OL,7,Fthe withdrawal of the last remaining
OL,8,Ftraffic officers based in the Scottish
OL,9,FBorders.
OL,11,FFor the first time in almost six
OL,12,Fdecades no dedicated patrols will
OL,13,Foperate out of the region - which has
OL,14,Fabout 2,000 miles (3,200km) of public
OL,15,Froads.
OL,17,FPolice Scotland said the relocation of
OL,18,Ftraffic officers to neighbouring
OL,19,FMidlothian would not have any impact on
OL,20,Fpatrols.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
