OL,3,GNEWSAClosure of region's last road
OL,4,Apolicing department a 'sad day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Brian Jones, vice-chair of the
OL,7,FPolice Federation, said it had happened
OL,8,Fwithout any consultation. He said:
OL,9,F"It's a very sad day that we're now
OL,10,Fseeing the closure of the last roads
OL,11,Fpolicing department in the Borders
OL,12,Fafter being present for nearly 60
OL,13,Fyears."
